 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1110) 'A coding agent session that loads every project file, every closed issue, and every past design spends context on history instead of the current task.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Read below for the file map, the context-layer table, the workflow-selection rules, and the technical decisions from `DECISIONS.md` not already covered by another RFD.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1110) 'RepoResident, a file-based operating harness for coding agents
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Weftspun3DStudio adopted RepoResident on 2026-07-23, replacing an earlier "MindLink" personal-memory approach, now archived to `.agent/areas/mindlink.md`. Context loads in five capped layers: `CLAUDE.md` (operating rules, every session), `STATE.md` (current state, rewritten in full each session, every session), one workflow file matched to the task, then project facts and decisions, then targeted source. Five roles (Architect, Builder, Fixer, Reviewer, Curator) carry different rules for the same repository, not conversational personas. `STATE.md` stays a live handoff, not a decision record; it holds no lasting content and does not become part of this RFD.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1110) 'RFD66606-1086 gives the Surface/DGX topology `PROJECT.md`'s sync-ownership rule depends on. RFD66606-1099 gives the operator command cheat sheet this harness's workflows point to for exact commands.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

