2026-08-25T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Working roles
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Rules for a phase, not conversational personas.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **Architect:** scopes and designs without writing implementation code.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **Builder:** implements an approved design without changing its structure silently.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **Fixer:** makes the smallest complete correction and avoids unrelated refactoring.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **Reviewer:** reports verified findings and does not rewrite unless asked.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **Curator:** maintains the harness and its bounded knowledge files.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Workflow selection
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-1110) '| Workflow       | For                                                                                                                |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-1110) '| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `bootstrap.md` | First session on a new or adopted project; `CLAUDE.md` still has `<fill>` placeholders, or `STATE.md` Session is 0 |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `patch.md`     | Small fix, cause known or trivially findable, no interface change, at most two files                               |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `debug.md`     | A defect whose cause is unknown; output is a named root cause with evidence, then `patch.md` or `feature.md`       |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `feature.md`   | New capability, or any change touching more than two files or any interface/schema/dependency                      |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `refactor.md`  | Structure improvement with zero behavior change; a bug found mid-refactor gets parked, not bundled                 |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `review.md`    | Reviewing a diff, PR, or branch; best run fresh, from a session that did not write the code                        |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-1110) '| `maintain.md`  | Every tenth session, or when a size budget is blown, or the user asks; checks the harness against the repository   |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-1110) '`feature.md`'s exit test: if a change has a single known site, no interface change, and obvious verification, it downgrades to `patch.md`. `patch.md` escalates to `feature.md` the moment an interface or schema must change, or the fix wants more than two files; it escalates to `debug.md` the moment five files are read and the cause still cannot be named with evidence.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Technical decisions not covered by another RFD
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-1110) 'From `.agent/DECISIONS.md`, append-only, project-specific choices this repository's own numbered RFDs do not yet record:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **2026-07-26, XR disembody:** the avatar exits at the exit spot facing the headset, the viewer stands one meter behind, and Move-to-Viewpoint, X, and the stick-click all work without opening a menu. Embody never shifts the rig's Y position. Reason: user-confirmed on the Galaxy XR editing flow.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **2026-07-26, LingBot Gaussian-splat worlds:** these use Spark with `orientationMode: none`, never an XYZRGB point stride, since the wrong stride scatters points. Gravity-aligned point clouds must not receive TripoSplat's X-flip.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-1110) '- **2026-06-26, API↔client contracts:** must land together, since `models.yaml` and `aiModelsCatalog.js`/`taskManager.js` describe the same models from two sides.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Decisions already carried by other RFDs, not repeated here: UI on the Surface, API on the DGX (RFD66606-1086); scp-based sync with no agent git push (RFD66606-1086, RFD66606-1099); RepoResident's own adoption, replacing MindLink (this RFD's README).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-1110) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-1110) 'Without a named procedure per task type, agents improvise process, and a large model and a small model handle ambiguity differently. Without a place for state to persist, knowledge learned in one session does not reach the next.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1110  1 LINE
 Text:Written
